{
  "id": "4s8DGFmrZxpX46Dd",
  "name": "D3 — WF-C4: Send Reply",
  "description": null,
  "active": true,
  "activeVersionId": "c0c9ca00-8a46-46f0-bc0c-bb444ea52fb1",
  "createdAt": "2026-05-19T13:05:03.963Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-08-13T12:50:31.515Z",
  "isArchived": false,
  "versionCounter": 5,
  "sourceWorkflowId": null,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "wfc4-sticky",
      "name": "WF-C4 Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        60,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## D3 — WF-C4: Send Reply\n\nCalled by WF-C2 after Claude produces a final text response.\nSends the reply to the customer via Twilio WhatsApp API.\n\n**Input (from WF-C2 via Execute Workflow):**\n- `phone` — customer E.164 number (+447700…)\n- `message` — reply text from Claude\n\n**Credentials needed before activation:**\n- Twilio HTTP Basic Auth (Account SID as username, Auth Token as password)\n  Set on the 'Send WhatsApp via Twilio' node.\n\n**Config placeholders to fill in ⚙️ Client Config:**\n- twilioMessagesUrl — full URL: https://api.twilio.com/2010-04-01/Accounts/ACxxxxx/Messages.json\n- twilioFromNumber — your WhatsApp-enabled Twilio number as: whatsapp:+447xxxxxxxx",
        "color": 4,
        "width": 680,
        "height": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wfc4-trigger",
      "name": "When Called by WF-C2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        80,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wfc4-config",
      "name": "⚙️ Client Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        300,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "name": "twilioMessagesUrl",
              "value": "https://api.twilio.com/2010-04-01/Accounts/YOUR_TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID/Messages.json",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c2",
              "name": "twilioFromNumber",
              "value": "whatsapp:+14155238886",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wfc4-send",
      "name": "Send WhatsApp via Twilio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('⚙️ Client Config').first().json.twilioMessagesUrl }}",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "twilioApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "form-urlencoded",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "From",
              "value": "={{ $('⚙️ Client Config').first().json.twilioFromNumber }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "To",
              "value": "={{ 'whatsapp:' + $('When Called by WF-C2').first().json.phone }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Body",
              "value": "={{ $('When Called by WF-C2').first().json.message }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "onError": "stopWorkflow",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "credentials": {
        "twilioApi": {
          "id": "CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Twilio account"
        }
      },
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "When Called by WF-C2": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "⚙️ Client Config",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "⚙️ Client Config": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send WhatsApp via Twilio",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
